# n3 — homing (mirrors demos/11-noita/114-homing.bqn)
# Row 0 the homing bolt (marker + target rel the cast resolved), row 1 a plain bolt, row 2 the quarry at posx 40, row 3 a bystander.
n 4
col keys num 0 1 2 3
col sparkBolt bool 1 1 0 0
col homing bool 1 0 0 0
col enemy bool 0 0 1 0
col posx num 10 10 40 0
col velx num 6 6 0 0
col health num 0 0 25 0
rel target 2 -1 -1 -1
ja 火花弾 sparkBolt
ja 追尾 homing
ja 敵 enemy
ja 体力 health
ja 標的物 target
